  "goodToKnow": "Erkaufen means to buy or gain something, often non-material, at a price: sich Zeit, Schweigen, Zustimmung erkaufen. Teuer erkauft means dearly bought: ein teuer erkaufter Frieden. Unlike kaufen, it often implies that the price was too high or the method dubious, as in bribery. Regular: erkaufte, erkauft."
